title: "Supply Chain Design Notes"
abstract: "A practitioner-oriented learning resource covering demand and forecasting, network design and digital connectivity, sourcing and supplier execution, internal operations, inventory, logistics and trade, customer and supplier relationships, supply-chain risk governance, response economics, disruption recovery, business continuity, and continuous improvement through original explanations, diagrams, datasets, knowledge checks, and integrated case studies."
